<p>The user gains a bonus to Spellpower equal to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20%, 25%, 30%, 35%, 40%</acronym> of your Cunning (Current bonus: <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">20, 25, 30, 35, 40</acronym>).</p>